```matlab
function ys = ode_ralston(f, t_init_final, y_init, n)
t_init = t_init_final(1);
t_final = t_init_final(2);
t = t_init;
y = y_init;
h = (t_final - t_init)/n;
ys = NaN(1,n+1);
ys(1) = y;
for i=1:n
    k1 = h * f(t,y);
    k2 = h * f(t+2/3*h,y+2/3*k1);
    k = (k1+3*k2)/4;
    t = t+h;
    y = y+k;
    ys(i+1) = y;
end
end
```

